[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3416227779","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111183#issuecomment-3416227779","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111183","id":3416227779,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ln3_D","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-17T16:17:00Z","updated_at":"2025-10-17T16:17:00Z","body":"@Calinou This PR should only have an impact on devices that support UMA. Your RTX 5090 doesn't support UMA, so we don't expect it to make a difference. The changes on LLVMpipe are within a margin of error too. So at most we can conclude that this doesn't cause regressions on that device","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3416227779/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3416569899","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111183#issuecomment-3416569899","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111183","id":3416569899,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LpLgr","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-17T18:07:11Z","updated_at":"2025-10-17T18:26:09Z","body":"Actually Calinou's performance on RTX 5090 are within the expected outcome (though the difference is so small it could be noise).\r\n\r\nEven though the RTX 5090 isn't UMA, this PR takes advantage of CPU-visible, device-local VRAM (which is plentiful in GPUs with ReBAR enabled). In other words, the RTX 5090 will pretend it is UMA and we will use that.\r\n\r\nThis means:\r\n\r\n1. CPU may execute slower, because CPU \"pushes\" data through the slower uncached PCIe bus (instead of having the GPU \"pull\" that data later through the bus). This could be theoretically improved if the copy itself is offloaded to a worker thread when possible (not always possible).\r\n2. GPU might execute faster.\r\n3. Overall may or may not execute faster, because some of the code now pushes data directly to GPU memory instead of doing two copies (first to staging area, then to GPU).\r\n4. Low 1% / 0.1% should improve because there's fewer GPU copy commands being scheduled. This is most likely the most noticeable difference and it was the only metric that consistently always improved for Framerate and GPU time, and consistently deteriorated for CPU time. This is exactly expected.\r\n5. On a true UMA architecture, the difference is that there is no slow PCIe bus. The CPU writes directly to GPU memory without downsides(\\*), making the PR (theoretically) more impactful on such Hardware.\r\n\r\nllvmpipe is an outlier in too many ways (it's not an actual GPU, it's so slow that noise is huge, and rendering threads compete with Godot's threads for execution time).\r\n\r\n(\\*) On some SoCs like the PS4 and PS5, the CPU bandwidth to RAM is artificially throttled though (to avoid CPU from starving the GPU's bandwidth) so the analysis is more nuanced in such cases as it will resemble the RTX 5090 case.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3416569899/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3416939574","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111183#issuecomment-3416939574","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111183","id":3416939574,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Lqlw2","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-17T20:07:40Z","updated_at":"2025-10-17T20:07:40Z","body":"@Calinou thanks for testing. As discussed with @clayjohn in [this thread on RocketChat](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/rendering?msg=8w4kFqTM6HiR8TdFG), we're removing the push constant changes, which significantly reduces the blast radius of this PR. Note that no `.glsl` shaders are modified after that change.\r\n\r\nUMA are only used for instance buffers now, and I have incorporated #104566 into this PR, as it was quite small and showed a measurable improvement in the 2D batching demo I tested (10% on my M1 Pro Max; I'll retest on my M4 Pro Max)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3416939574/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3417485999","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111183#issuecomment-3417485999","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111183","id":3417485999,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LsrKv","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-17T23:12:51Z","updated_at":"2025-10-17T23:13:51Z","body":"> device-local VRAM (which is plentiful in GPUs with ReBAR enabled). In other words, the RTX 5090 will pretend it is UMA and we will use that.\r\n\r\nNote that the NVIDIA Windows driver only enables ReBAR by default in specific games that are known to benefit from it (according to the per-game profile), but on Linux, it *seems* to be enabled for everything by default as long as it's enabled in the UEFI. I can confirm it's enabled on my end.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"291\" height=\"103\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0d03ef26-c8dc-4175-83a1-de8942a7cdde\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3417485999/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3434861579","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111183#issuecomment-3434861579","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111183","id":3434861579,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Mu9QL","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-23T02:39:24Z","updated_at":"2025-10-23T02:39:24Z","body":"@AThousandShips thanks – I've incorporated your changes!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3434861579/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3444005320","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111183#issuecomment-3444005320","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111183","id":3444005320,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NR1nI","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-24T16:30:13Z","updated_at":"2025-10-24T16:30:13Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3444005320/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448216991","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111183#issuecomment-3448216991","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111183","id":3448216991,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Nh52f","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-26T08:46:10Z","updated_at":"2025-10-27T13:28:57Z","body":"Working on pinning down the specifics but this caused a regression on (at least) Windows, seemingly with combinations of parallax layers and ui, seems to be compiler specific\r\n\r\nWill make a report on Monday or when I can pin down the specifics\r\n\r\nEdit: Seems to be mingw specific, though can't test much further, but it happens on debug and release builds with and without production build mode for release builds on mingw, but not on debug builds on msvc, haven't tested production or release builds with msvc but seems to be conclusive\r\n\r\nWill make an issue with an MRP later today or tomorrow","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448216991/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3456215400","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111183#issuecomment-3456215400","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111183","id":3456215400,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OAalo","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-28T12:25:16Z","updated_at":"2025-10-28T12:25:16Z","body":"Made an issue report for this:\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112121","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3456215400/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3460649151","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111183#issuecomment-3460649151","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111183","id":3460649151,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ORVC_","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-29T09:52:14Z","updated_at":"2025-10-29T09:52:14Z","body":"This PR seems to have caused a big performance regression in D3D12. In the commit right before this PR, I get about 145~ FPS in the editor, but with this PR, it drops to 60~ FPS. I'll investigate what caused it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3460649151/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3462101861","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111183#issuecomment-3462101861","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111183","id":3462101861,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OW3tl","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-29T15:06:36Z","updated_at":"2025-10-29T15:06:36Z","body":"> This PR seems to have caused a big performance regression in D3D12. In the commit right before this PR, I get about 145~ FPS in the editor, but with this PR, it drops to 60~ FPS. I'll investigate what caused it.\r\n\r\nWhat GPU and driver? What's the log info? (all info you'll be asked when creating a ticket). And of course the MRP.\r\n\r\nI'm specifically interested in knowing which one you get of these msgs:\r\n\r\n1. `D3D12: Device supports GPU UPLOAD heap.` (only printed in **verbose** logging mode).\r\n2. `D3D12: Device does NOT support GPU UPLOAD heap. ReBAR must be enabled for this feature. Regular UPLOAD heaps will be used as fallback.` (printed as a warning).\r\n\r\nGodot will try to use `D3D12_HEAP_TYPE_GPU_UPLOAD` when supported, else it will use `D3D12_HEAP_TYPE_UPLOAD`. These two can have different performance profiles. If your system is using `D3D12_HEAP_TYPE_GPU_UPLOAD`, try forcing it off by modifying the source code (look for `dynamic_persistent_upload_heap = D3D12_HEAP_TYPE_GPU_UPLOAD;` in the code).\r\n\r\nIn both cases, the way we upload data to GPU changed compared to how it worked before the PR, though `D3D12_HEAP_TYPE_UPLOAD` resembles a little more to how it was before.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3462101861/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3462105085","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111183#issuecomment-3462105085","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111183","id":3462105085,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OW4f9","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-29T15:07:09Z","updated_at":"2025-10-29T15:07:09Z","body":"Oh I just saw you submitted a PR with a fix. Cool.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3462105085/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]